OL,3,GNEWSA#8bn submarine deal last-minute   
OL,4,Amove, expert says                      
OL,6,FA naval expert has called a #8bn deal  
OL,7,Fto upgrade the UK's nuclear submarines 
OL,8,Fa "bit of a last-minute thing".        
OL,10,FThe five-year deal awarded to defence  
OL,11,Ffirm Babcock is set to create 3,000    
OL,12,Fjobs and around 2,500 apprentice and   
OL,13,Fgraduate roles - mainly across         
OL,14,FPlymouth, Clyde and Bristol, the       
OL,15,FMinistry of Defence (MoD) said.        
OL,17,FHowever, the announcement has drawn    
OL,18,Fcriticism with frustration over the    
OL,19,Flength of time it has taken for an     
OL,20,Fagreement to be reached.               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
