OL,3,GNEWSA#8bn submarine deal last-minute   
OL,4,Amove, expert says                      
OL,6,FPete Sandeman, editor of the Navy      
OL,7,FLookout website, said the announcement 
OL,8,Fwas "broadly very positive", but       
OL,9,Fquestioned why it had taken several    
OL,10,Fyears to sort out. Defence Secretary   
OL,11,FWes Streeting said the MoD was focused 
OL,12,Fon delivering on time and on budget.   
